{"n12620570402":{"checked":"2026-08-22","facts":[{"k":"facility_identity","v":"江神温泉共同浴場","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["egamionsen.com"],"urls":["https://egamionsen.com/","https://egamionsen.com/about/"]},{"k":"opening_hours","v":"通常は15:00〜22:00（最終受付21:30）。7月1日〜8月31日、12月1日〜3月31日は13:00〜22:00（最終受付21:30）。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["egamionsen.com"],"urls":["https://egamionsen.com/","https://egamionsen.com/about/"]},{"k":"closed_days","v":"定休日は水曜・第三火曜。祝日等により前後する場合がある。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["egamionsen.com"],"urls":["https://egamionsen.com/","https://egamionsen.com/about/"]},{"k":"price","v":"入浴料は大人600円、小人300円。フェイスタオル250円、貸しバスタオル300円、タオルセット400円。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["egamionsen.com"],"urls":["https://egamionsen.com/","https://egamionsen.com/about/"]},{"k":"access","v":"新潟県南魚沼郡湯沢町湯沢1-1-8。JR越後湯沢駅東口から徒歩3分、駐車場6台。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["egamionsen.com"],"urls":["https://egamionsen.com/","https://egamionsen.com/about/"]},{"k":"amenities","v":"浴場にボディーソープとリンスインシャンプーを備える。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["egamionsen.com"],"urls":["https://egamionsen.com/","https://egamionsen.com/about/"]},{"k":"luggage","v":"脱衣所入口前と脱衣所内に鍵付き貴重品ロッカーがあり、有料100円。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["egamionsen.com"],"urls":["https://egamionsen.com/","https://egamionsen.com/about/"]},{"k":"solo_insight","v":{"title":"江神温泉共同浴場は夏冬の13時開場と通常15時開場を越後湯沢駅東口3分で使い分ける","insight":"「通常は15:00〜22:00（最終受付21:30）。7月1日〜8月31日、12月1日〜3月31日は13:00〜22:00（最終受付21:30）。」なので、夏冬の一人時間は13時から、春秋は15時からと分けます。「定休日は水曜・第三火曜。祝日等により前後する場合がある。」ため、祝日付近は固定曜日だけで決めません。「新潟県南魚沼郡湯沢町湯沢1-1-8。JR越後湯沢駅東口から徒歩3分、駐車場6台。」は駅待ち時間にも使える動線ですが、車は6台に絞られます。「入浴料は大人600円、小人300円。フェイスタオル250円、貸しバスタオル300円、タオルセット400円。」と「脱衣所入口前と脱衣所内に鍵付き貴重品ロッカーがあり、有料100円。」を先に選び、タオルと100円を用意する計画です。","anchors":["江神温泉共同浴場","通常は15:00〜22:00（最終受付21:30）。7月1日〜8月31日、12月1日〜3月31日は13:00〜22:00（最終受付21:30）。","定休日は水曜・第三火曜。祝日等により前後する場合がある。","入浴料は大人600円、小人300円。フェイスタオル250円、貸しバスタオル300円、タオルセット400円。","新潟県南魚沼郡湯沢町湯沢1-1-8。JR越後湯沢駅東口から徒歩3分、駐車場6台。","浴場にボディーソープとリンスインシャンプーを備える。","脱衣所入口前と脱衣所内に鍵付き貴重品ロッカーがあり、有料100円。"],"quality":"grounded","policyVersion":"official-provenance-v2"},"n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["egamionsen.com"],"urls":["https://egamionsen.com/","https://egamionsen.com/about/"]}]},"n6237428885":{"checked":"2026-08-12","facts":[{"conflict":false,"k":"status","n":1,"official":false,"src":["rurubu.jp"],"urls":["https://rurubu.jp/andmore/spot/80015616"],"v":"open"},{"conflict":false,"k":"open_period","n":1,"official":false,"src":["rurubu.jp"],"urls":["https://rurubu.jp/andmore/spot/80015616"],"v":"seasonal"},{"conflict":false,"k":"price","n":1,"official":false,"src":["yuru-to.net"],"urls":["https://yuru-to.net/detail.php?oid=358"],"v":500},{"conflict":true,"k":"hours","n":1,"official":false,"src":["jalan.net"],"urls":["https://www.jalan.net/kankou/spt_15586cd2112104535/"],"v":"10:00-19:00"},{"conflict":true,"k":"hours","n":1,"official":false,"src":["rurubu.jp"],"urls":["https://rurubu.jp/andmore/spot/80015616"],"v":"13:00-19:30"},{"conflict":false,"k":"closed_days","n":1,"official":false,"src":["rurubu.jp"],"urls":["https://rurubu.jp/andmore/spot/80015616"],"v":"火曜（季節により変動）"},{"conflict":false,"k":"luggage","n":1,"official":false,"src":["tripadvisor.jp"],"urls":["https://www.tripadvisor.jp/ShowUserReviews-g1121152-d1424892-r425445944-Isaribi_Onsen_Otohimenoyu-Awashimaura_mura_Iwafune_gun_Niigata_Prefecture_Koshi.html"],"v":"locker"},{"conflict":false,"k":"payment_method","n":1,"official":false,"src":["yuru-to.net"],"urls":["https://yuru-to.net/detail.php?oid=358"],"v":"ticket_machine"},{"conflict":false,"k":"wash_area","n":1,"official":false,"src":["yuru-to.net"],"urls":["https://yuru-to.net/detail.php?oid=358"],"v":"yes"},{"conflict":false,"k":"bring_towel","n":1,"official":false,"src":["yuru-to.net"],"urls":["https://yuru-to.net/detail.php?oid=358"],"v":"rental"},{"conflict":false,"k":"hours","n":1,"official":false,"src":[