norinka/9/2/1/1011.html"]},{"k":"price","v":"大人850円（入湯税150円含む）、4歳〜小学生350円、3歳以下無料、障害者250円。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yuzawa.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yuzawa.lg.jp/soshikikarasagasu/kikkakusangyoukankoubu/kankyonorinka/9/2/1/1011.html"]},{"k":"access","v":"駐車場は32台で、電話番号は025-787-2787。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yuzawa.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yuzawa.lg.jp/soshikikarasagasu/kikkakusangyoukankoubu/kankyonorinka/9/2/1/1011.html"]},{"k":"facilities","v":"石造りの湯船は15人ほどが入ることができ、小さな休憩所がある。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yuzawa.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yuzawa.lg.jp/soshikikarasagasu/kikkakusangyoukankoubu/kankyonorinka/9/2/1/1011.html"]},{"k":"conditions","v":"湯沢フィッシングパークやスキー場が近く、レジャーのあとに便利な浴場として案内される。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yuzawa.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yuzawa.lg.jp/soshikikarasagasu/kikkakusangyoukankoubu/kankyonorinka/9/2/1/1011.html"]},{"k":"solo_insight","v":{"title":"土樽共同浴場　岩の湯は20時30分最終受付を850円・水曜振替・32台駐車で組む","insight":"公式名は「岩の湯」で、「営業時間は午前10時から午後9時で、最終受付は午後8時30分。」です。「定休日は水曜日で、祝日・年末年始・お盆期間は後日振り替え。」なので、水曜の扱いを当日確認します。「大人850円（入湯税150円含む）、4歳〜小学生350円、3歳以下無料、障害者250円。」を区分で選びます。「駐車場は32台で、電話番号は025-787-2787。」です。石造りで15人ほど入る湯船と小休憩所を使い、近くのスキー場やフィッシングパーク後に寄る計画です。","anchors":["岩の湯","営業時間は午前10時から午後9時で、最終受付は午後8時30分。","定休日は水曜日で、祝日・年末年始・お盆期間は後日振り替え。","大人850円（入湯税150円含む）、4歳〜小学生350円、3歳以下無料、障害者250円。","駐車場は32台で、電話番号は025-787-2787。","石造りの湯船は15人ほどが入ることができ、小さな休憩所がある。","湯沢フィッシングパークやスキー場が近く、レジャーのあとに便利な浴場として案内される。"],"quality":"grounded","policyVersion":"official-provenance-v2"},"n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["town.yuzawa.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.town.yuzawa.lg.jp/soshikikarasagasu/kikkakusangyoukankoubu/kankyonorinka/9/2/1/1011.html"]}]},"w1206760251":{"checked":"2026-08-11","facts":[{"conflict":false,"k":"status","n":1,"official":false,"src":["onsen.nifty.com"],"urls":["https://onsen.nifty.com/nagaoka-onsen/onsen011733/"],"v":"closed_permanently"},{"conflict":false,"k":"city","n":2,"official":false,"src":["nagaoka-navi.or.jp","ja.wikipedia.org"],"urls":["https://nagaoka-navi.or.jp/spot/11369","https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%89%E5%B3%B6%E8%B0%B7%E6%B8%A9%E6%B3%89"],"v":"長岡市"},{"conflict":false,"k":"price","n":1,"official":false,"src":["dream-fact.com"],"urls":["https://www.dream-fact.com/niigataken/nagaoka/34043/"],"v":600},{"conflict":false,"k":"wash_area","n":1,"official":false,"src":["onsen.nifty.com"],"urls":["https://onsen.nifty.com/nagaoka-onsen/onsen011733/kuchikomi/0000162078/"],"v":"yes"},{"conflict":false,"k":"luggage","n":1,"official":false,"src":["onsen.nifty.com"],"urls":["https://onsen.nifty.com/nagaoka-onsen/onsen011733/kuchikomi/0000162078/"],"v":"shelf_only"},{"conflict":true,"k":"status","n":1,"official":false,"src":["nagaoka-navi.or.jp"],"urls":["https://nagaoka-navi.or.jp/spot/11369"],"v":"closed_temporarily"},{"conflict":true,"k":"status","n":1,"official":false,"src":["dream-fact.com"],"urls":["https://www.dream-fact.com/niigataken/nagaoka/34043/"],"v":"open"}]},"w1346747529":{"checked":"2026-08-22","facts":[{"k":"facility_identity","v":"青少年宿泊施設 あかたにの家","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["city.shibata.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.city.shibata.lg.jp/shisetsu/kyoiku/sonota/1005027.html"]},{"k":"opening_hours","v":"日帰り・宿泊の利用時間は午前9時〜午後4時30分。開館期間は4月1日〜11月30日。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["city.shibata.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.city.shibata.lg.jp/shisetsu/kyoiku/sonota/1005027.html"]},{"k":"closed_days","v":"休館日は月曜日（祝日の場合は翌日）と冬期間の12月から3月。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["city.shibata.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.city.shibata.lg.jp/shisetsu/kyoiku/sonota/1005027.html"]},{"k":"price","v":"宿泊は中学生以下（指導者含む）が1泊1人1,210円、上記以外が1泊1人1,510円。市外の利用は5割増。","n":1,"official":true,"conflict":false,"src":["city.shibata.lg.jp"],"urls":["https://www.city.shibata.lg.jp/shisetsu/kyoiku/sonota/1005027.html"]},{"k":"access","v":"所在地は新発田市上赤谷2173番地で、JR新発田駅からバス約30分。無料駐車